@startuml 图2-6 序列图：兑换商品（UC-08 用例实现）
' 依据：需求规格说明书 §2.3.2 UC-08 事件流；BR-09 / BR-12 / BR-15
' 重点表达：幂等键、行锁、锁后复核、失败回滚、事务提交后异步

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "市民" as U
participant "前端\n(RedeemConfirmPage)" as FE
participant "HTTP 层" as API
participant "RedeemUsecase\n(事务边界)" as UC
participant "Repo\n(sqlc + Tx)" as R
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "Outbox Worker" as W
participant "商户 / 运营" as M

U -> FE : 点击"立即兑换"
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/redeem-orders\n(Idempotency-Key: uuid)
activate API
API -> UC : Redeem(userID, skuID, idemKey)
activate UC

UC -> R : FindOrderByIdemKey(idemKey)
R -> DB : SELECT * FROM redeem_order WHERE idempotency_key=?
DB --> R : order?
R --> UC : existing?

alt 幂等键已处理（BR-15）
  UC --> API : existing order
  API --> FE : 200 {orderNo, redeemCode}（不重复扣分）
else 首次请求
  UC -> R : BeginTx()
  activate R
  R -> DB : SELECT balance, frozen FROM point_account\nWHERE user_id=? FOR UPDATE
  R -> DB : SELECT stock, status FROM product_sku\nWHERE id=? FOR UPDATE
  Note right of DB : 两把行锁按固定顺序获取\n（account → sku），避免死锁

  UC -> UC : 锁后复核（禁止先查后写）

  alt 商品下架 / 库存不足 / 积分不足（BR-09）
    R -> DB : ROLLBACK
    deactivate R
    UC --> API : ErrOutOfStock / ErrInsufficientPoints
    API --> FE : 409 {code, 剩余积分 / 库存}
    FE --> U : 提示失败，账户无任何变化
  else 复核通过
    R -> DB : INSERT point_txn(type=REDEEM, amount=-points)
    R -> DB : UPDATE point_account SET balance = balance - ?
    R -> DB : UPDATE product_sku SET stock = stock - 1, sold_count = sold_count + 1
    R -> DB : INSERT redeem_order(orderNo, status=PENDING, redeemCode)
    R -> DB : INSERT event_outbox(OrderPaid)
    R -> DB : COMMIT
    deactivate R
    UC --> API : {orderNo, redeemCode, 剩余积分}
    API --> FE : 201 Created
    FE --> U : 展示核销码与订单详情
  end
end
deactivate UC
deactivate API

== 事务提交之后（异步，失败可重试） ==

W -> DB : 轮询 event_outbox (type=OrderPaid)
DB --> W : events
W -> M : 通知新订单（站内信 / 邮件模拟）
M --> W : ack
W -> DB : UPDATE event_outbox SET status='SENT'

== 备选：订单取消（BR-12 原路回滚） ==

U -> FE : 取消订单
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/redeem-orders/{no}/cancel
API -> UC : Cancel(orderNo)
activate UC
UC -> R : BeginTx()
R -> DB : SELECT * FROM redeem_order FOR UPDATE
R -> DB : INSERT point_txn(type=REFUND, amount=+points)\n并 UPDATE point_account（补反向流水，不改原流水）
R -> DB : UPDATE product_sku SET stock = stock + 1
R -> DB : UPDATE redeem_order SET status='CANCELLED'
R -> DB : COMMIT
deactivate R
UC --> API : ok
deactivate UC
API --> FE : 200 {status: CANCELLED}
FE --> U : 提示积分已退回

note over R, DB
  **append-only 的意义**：取消不修改原 REDEEM 流水，
  而是补一条 REFUND。这样任何时刻都能回放"谁在何时扣了几分"（BR-08）。
end note

@enduml
